cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Shramko SOG LOD Converter: giant Gaussian-splat PLY to Streamed SOG with levels of detail, in the browser"
abstract: "Browser-based, out-of-core converter that turns 3D Gaussian Splatting PLY files of hundreds of millions of splats into a multi-LOD Streamed SOG archive (lod-meta.json + SOG chunks) for SuperSplat and the PlayCanvas engine, using spatial tiling, WebGPU decimation and a streaming ZIP64 writer."
